{"title":"Right wing creators are dominating L.A. protest coverage","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/right-wing-creators-are-dominating","date":1749660449000,"content":"<p><em><strong>To unlock my reporting on how the internet is reshaping politics, business, media, and culture, and to read my deep dives into emerging online spaces and internet trends, <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe\">become a paid subscriber today</a>!</strong></em></p><p><em><strong>I cannot produce this newsletter without your financial support. <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe\">Your money goes directly towards reporting costs</a>.</strong></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\" width=\"1407\" height=\"27\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Last week we witnessed one of the most striking ruptures in the alliance between the tech and political worlds: the public blowout between Trump and Musk. After pouring hundreds of millions into Trump’s campaign and serving as a special adviser on the “Department of Government Efficiency\" Musk is now on the outs with Trump and his future within the MAGA movement is uncertain. </p><p>At 3:00am this morning, Musk <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/06/11/business/elon-musk-trump-feud.html\">began groveling</a> for forgiveness. He posted on X, “I regret some of my posts about President realDonaldTrump last week. They went too far.” </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IYjw!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07567572-33e0-4135-b91e-f1beab011d04_950x520.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IYjw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07567572-33e0-4135-b91e-f1beab011d04_950x520.png\" width=\"576\" height=\"315.2842105263158\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IYjw!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07567572-33e0-4135-b91e-f1beab011d04_950x520.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IYjw!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07567572-33e0-4135-b91e-f1beab011d04_950x520.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IYjw!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07567572-33e0-4135-b91e-f1beab011d04_950x520.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IYjw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F07567572-33e0-4135-b91e-f1beab011d04_950x520.png 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Brace Belden is the co-host of the podcast TrueAnon and has been covering Elon and the right wing internet universe for years. He <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HaRd1gsx6q8\">joined me</a> on this week’s podcast to break down Musk's rise in the MAGA world, the big blowup, what this fracturing means for the right going forward, and what's next for Elon. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HaRd1gsx6q8\">Watch here</a>!</p><div><div></div></div><div><div><div><p>User Mag is a 100% reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, become a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div><h2>Right wing creators are dominating L.A. protest coverage</h2>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/right-wing-creators-are-dominating\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>","author":"Taylor Lorenz","siteTitle":"usermag.co","siteHash":"95f273abc07d53f60c12a9877d5e701fc5d46103659afbdcd53f0429eec6280d","entryHash":"aabfe91432934da3b1d67612a60cfdf0f64d90c063730675b73a4f65ed559ee9","category":"Sites"}